Not covered
-----------

The game's data files (models, textures, sounds, maps, definitions) are not
part of this repository and are not licensed by it. They remain the property
of their author.

Third-party software used by this project (Three.js, SvelteKit, Tailwind CSS
and others listed in package.json) is licensed under its own terms. Parts of
the runtime re-implement algorithms from Blitz3D by Blitz Research
(https://github.com/blitz-research/blitz3d); see that project for its licence.
